# UI conventions

## Layout

- Page chrome lives in `src/components/layout/` (`PageShell`, `PageHeader`, `MonthNav`, empty/loading)
- Page shell: `max-w-6xl`, `gap-6`, `p-6 md:p-8`
- Use `PageHeader` for title, description, and primary actions
- Prefer dense tables/cards; icons only where they speed scanning
- Income / expense amounts: `text-income` / `text-expense`
- Phone vs desktop splits at `md` (768px). Bottom tabs + drawers below; top nav + dialogs from `md` up.

## Components

- App shell (nav, theme, gate, onboarding): `src/app/`
- Add shadcn pieces with: `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <component>` → `src/components/ui/`
- Composers: `ResponsiveModal` / `ComposerFormModal` (drawer sticky footer; skip autofocus on mobile)
- Destructive deletes: `ConfirmDeleteDialog` (alert-dialog)
- Loading / empty / error states on every data screen

## Styles

- Tokens and motion live under `src/styles/` (`10-tokens`, `20-theme`, …). Do not dump large rules back into `styles.css`.
- Safe-area / tab bar: `--safe-*`, `--tab-bar-h` (needs `viewport-fit=cover` on the root meta)
- Keep the neutral IBM Plex / token look
- Avoid purple gradients, cream+terracotta “AI landing” looks, emoji, glow pills
- No cards in heroes; cards only when they group interactive content
